* FF - FIND FILES

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

A - Purpose, syntax and examples

:A
* FF - FIND FILES

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

Syntax:
    SYSUTLS:FF [dir:]filespec[,filespec...] [drives][/options]

Searches directories for matching filenames. This installed version
expands abbreviated name patterns automatically; /E toggles exact matching
and /P toggles paging.

Example: SYSUTLS:FF HELP:USER.HLP

Results describe locations, not permission to read or execute them. This
private search utility does not grant caller access.

See HELP COMMANDS for the command index.
